{"segment_id": "segment_00016", "start": 480.0, "end": 510.0, "speech": "我还得平常多去接触一些内容积攒，对吧？否则我表达都有了，但是我不知道我要说什么。就像你汉语表达说清楚这事儿没问题吧？但你试试你汉语能不能拿这个说个五分钟，对吧？说哪怕说个两分钟、一分钟，如果你都说不出来，那就说明你对这方面的内容过于缺少了。哎，多去收集内容，好吧？不多说了啊！家庭作业啊，Smith先写，保证正确率，大声朗读。摘要写作，写完对答案。Tell the story啊，composition", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000040.webp", "time": 497.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "Do you think old cars should be used or", "kept in museums? Why?", "Would you prefer to own something (a)", "very old or (b) very modern? Why?", "Imagine it is the year 2100. In what way", "do you think things like cars, aeroplanes,", "buildings, etc. will differ from those of", "today?"], "scores": [0.99851, 0.9788, 0.97807, 0.98914, 0.99302, 0.97922, 0.9728, 0.97619, 0.99498], "boxes": [[[58.0, 135.0], [560.0, 135.0], [560.0, 198.0], [58.0, 198.0]], [[186.0, 332.0], [1116.0, 326.0], [1116.0, 392.0], [186.0, 397.0]], [[190.0, 393.0], [755.0, 393.0], [755.0, 462.0], [190.0, 462.0]], [[190.0, 471.0], [1101.0, 475.0], [1101.0, 541.0], [190.0, 538.0]], [[188.0, 534.0], [988.0, 534.0], [988.0, 603.0], [188.0, 603.0]], [[189.0, 611.0], [1095.0, 617.0], [1095.0, 688.0], [189.0, 683.0]], [[191.0, 674.0], [1127.0, 676.0], [1127.0, 748.0], [191.0, 745.0]], [[194.0, 739.0], [1064.0, 739.0], [1064.0, 804.0], [194.0, 804.0]], [[190.0, 798.0], [358.0, 802.0], [357.0, 868.0], [189.0, 864.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000041.webp", "time": 502.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["计划"], "scores": [0.70852], "boxes": [[[1645.0, 56.0], [1729.0, 52.0], [1730.0, 87.0], [1646.0, 91.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000042.webp", "time": 505.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["1.Ask me if写&朗读", "2.", "摘要写作写&答案"], "scores": [0.93801, 0.97786, 0.9816], "boxes": [[[170.0, 229.0], [623.0, 232.0], [623.0, 286.0], [170.0, 283.0]], [[176.0, 340.0], [256.0, 344.0], [253.0, 384.0], [173.0, 380.0]], [[234.0, 337.0], [609.0, 337.0], [609.0, 389.0], [234.0, 389.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000043.webp", "time": 507.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["1.Ask me if写&朗